      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIDDING ME (6) has the clearest winning profile after back-to-back CL2 wins at this track, the latest when travelling well and arriving in time to beat Quick Cookie by half a length. Rates highly on those efforts and this looks a winnable race on the back of those efforts. Can keep winning. POLYVANOVA (7) is the main danger on ratings, having been close enough when sixth behind Sir Bear A Lot here last start and having consistent enough track and distance figures to rebound, though she has to finish the mile off more cleanly. ARAFISIO (4) resumed with a head second at this venue at long odds and beat POLYVANOVA in that same race, while her previous CL2 win here over Win To Retire gives the form some depth. HERE FOR CHEQUES (3) comes back from stronger Ascot and Belmont races and can feature in the finish of this suitable race. GINGERS SISTER (8) can run a better race out to this trip now.",
